@0009 = ~This mod only works with BG2EE/EET/IWDEE.~
@0 = ~Telim'Gar's Insurmountable Challenges~
@1 = ~Replica~
@10 = ~Random monsters do not yield XP.~
@11 = ~Multiply the number of random monsters spawned
(Component can be changed during gameplay)~
@12 = ~Double~
@13 = ~Triple~
@14 = ~Quadruple~
@15 = ~This option requires the main component~
@16 = ~Cursed Spirit~
@17 = ~Add an additional disadvantage to each area~
@18 = ~Challenge Golem~
@19 = ~Exit Rune~
@110 = ~This is one of the runes required to validate your victory in Telim'Gar's Insurmountable Challenges.~
@111 = ~It's the final rune-dooown... We are the champioooons! You have triumphed over Telim'Gar's Insurmountable Challenges, and this rune will allow you to bring the adventure to a definitive end by returning to the Prime Material Plane. However, there will probably be no bard to learn of your exploits and turn them into an epic ballad.~
@112 = ~Random monsters drop random treasure
(Component can be changed during gameplay)~
@113 = ~of little value~
@114 = ~of average value~
@115 = ~of great value~
@116 = ~Impossible difficulty, Golem in Athkatla~
@117 = ~Variable difficulty, Golem in Watcher's Keep~
@118 = ~Standard difficulty, Golem in Amkethran~
@119 = ~Compilation of dialogues and scripts~
@120 = ~Installation of required resources~
@121 = ~Installation of the Dump~
@122 = ~Installation of the Silent Necropolis~
@123 = ~Installation of the Plant Labyrinth~
@124 = ~Installation of the Steel Tombs~
@125 = ~Installation of the Maze~
@126 = ~Installation of Antimaginium~
@127 = ~Installation of the Furnace~
@128 = ~Installation of the Tomb of the Great Wyrm~
@129 = ~Installation of the Playroom of the Evil~
@130 = ~Installation of the Forge~
@131 = ~Installation of the Pocket of Reality~
@132 = ~Installation of the final area~
@133 = ~Add items that allow the party to rest or save during the challenges.~
@134 = ~Portable Portal~
@135 = ~You found this portable portal in a dump. It allows you to travel back and forth to the overseer's room, and it only works within Telim'Gar's challenge complex.~
@136 = ~Remove the component: one monster at a time~
@137 = ~Remove the component: no random treasure~
@138 = ~Scepter of Saving~
@139 = ~This scepter allows you to save the game even when enemies are present or area-of-effect spells are active. Be careful: reloading may be dangerous!~
@140 = ~^GGame saved^-~
@141 = ~This item does not function outside Telim'Gar's challenge complex.~
@142 = ~This option is not offered if the golem is placed in ToB.~
@143 = ~As this boss dies, you notice that it drops the Portable Portal.~
